## Overview Aura Health needed a companion mobile application that felt

supportive rather than clinical. Patients with chronic conditions already
experience high mental fatigue; tracking their health shouldn't add to it. ##
Approach - Warm, organic color palette reducing medical anxiety. -
Micro-interactions designed to celebrate small daily milestones. - One-tap
logging with accessibility-first typography.\
